      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"v\": 1, \"title\": \"Krea 2 Text to Image + LoRA Stack\", \"subtitle\": \"The clean Krea 2 Turbo graph with one LoRA Loader for the whole stack. Trigger words flow into the prompt on their own wire.\", \"author\": \"AusBoss\", \"layout\": \"card\", \"accent\": \"\", \"body\": \"## Setup\\nCopy the supplied media from `example_workflows/inputs/` into `ComfyUI/input/`. Choose each installed model in its loader; if you keep models in subfolders, select those paths. Download links below name the standard destination folders.\\n\\n## How it works\\n1. **LoRA Loader** holds every LoRA in one node. The pill turns a row on or off, the name is a drag-to-scrub strength, and the **ⓘ** card lists the file's trigger words — click a word to add it to the `triggers` output.\\n2. **Concatenate** puts those trigger words in front of your prompt, so switching LoRAs never means editing the prompt.\\n3. **Krea 2 Encode** encodes both prompts in one node. **Seed** is pinned (Fixed) to reproduce this exact image; switch it to Random for variations, and *Use last run* brings a good one back.\\n4. **Queue.** The Run Timer shows how long the render took.\\n\\n## Try\\n- The tarot row is enabled. The optional anime row starts off; download and select that LoRA before enabling it.\\n- Drag a row's name left or right to scrub its strength. Shift is the fine step.\\n- Gear menu → **Absorb loader chain** pulls any other LoRA loaders wired into the model line into this stack.\\n- 8 steps, CFG 1, `er_sde` / `simple` is the Krea 2 Turbo recipe. 832×1216 is the portrait size the tarot look likes.\\n\\n## Save the prompt\\nSave Image writes the PNG with its workflow and a matching `.txt` sidecar containing the assembled LoRA triggers and prompt. Disconnect caption_text if you only want the image.\", \"models\": [{\"name\": \"krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"diffusion_models\", \"size\": \"13.1 GB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors\", \"note\": \"Official FP8 Turbo build, selected in the loader. The example was tested with a different local FP8 Turbo file.\"}, {\"name\": \"qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"text_encoders\", \"size\": \"5.2 GB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors\", \"note\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"qwen_image_vae.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"vae\", \"size\": \"254 MB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\", \"note\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"krea2_vintagetarot.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"loras\", \"size\": \"469 MB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/loras/krea2_vintagetarot.safetensors\", \"note\": \"trigger: vintage tarot style\"}, {\"name\": \"krea2_retroanime.safetensors\", \"dir\": \"loras\", \"size\": \"469 MB\", \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/resolve/main/loras/krea2_retroanime.safetensors\", \"note\": \"trigger: purple retro anime style — off by default, flip it on to swap the look\"}], \"packs\": [{\"name\": \"ComfyUI-AusBoss\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/ausboss/ComfyUI-AusBoss\", \"node\": \"AUSBOSS_NODES_LoraLoader\"}], \"links\": [{\"label\": \"GitHub · ausboss\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/ausboss\"}, {\"label\": \"Civitai · AusBoss\", \"url\": \"https://civitai.com/user/AusBoss\"}, {\"label\": \"X · Zanzibased\", \"url\": \"https://x.com/Zanzibased\"}]}"
      ]
    },
